==Maori==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|mi|poz-pol-pro|*fenua}} (cognate with {{cog|haw|henua}} and {{cog|ty|fenua}}), from Proto-Central Pacific ''*vanua'', from {{inh|mi|poz-oce-pro|*panua}}, from {{inh|mi|poz-pro|*banua}} (compare with Malay {{m|ms|benua}}).

